.TH BASHMENU 1 "2026-09-13" "v0.0.1" "HA Bash Menu Manual"
.SH NAME
bashmenu \- lightweight Textual TUI menu engine and settings manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bashmenu.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bashmenu
is a data-driven, Textual-based Text User Interface (TUI) menu engine designed
for Linux system administration, settings management, and command execution. It
reads its menu structure from a YAML-formatted menu file, dynamically
interpolates configurations and system environment variables, and supports
custom Nerd Fonts, visual file chooser dialogs, and modular code templates.
